OL,3,GNEWSAPE teacher boxes clever to win
OL,4,Atitle on his day off
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany of us might have felt like
OL,7,Fpunching something after a day at work.
OL,8,FPE teacher turned professional boxer
OL,9,FJake Goodwin does just that.
OL,11,FThe 28-year-old from Doncaster is now a
OL,12,Fchampion in the ring, having upset the
OL,13,Fodds after accepting his latest
OL,14,Fchallenge with just two weeks' notice `
OL,15,Fand before he even had permission to
OL,16,Ftake the day off.
OL,18,F"I am not just a boxer, I am a normal
OL,19,Fguy," he explains after getting home
OL,20,Ffrom his weekly supermarket shop ahead
OL,21,Fof returning to the day job on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
