OL,3,GNEWSAPE teacher boxes clever to win
OL,4,Atitle on his day off
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I do my shopping, I work full time
OL,7,FMonday to Friday, nine to five, and
OL,8,Ftrain outside of my day job."
